00,33566200,39100400,59345500,16999600,16631700,76684200,16950100,22668900,10184900,7850200,12564700,4489800,3210700,1175100,8400500,1402800,8625700,18525700,9449600,3095100,1987000,29720100,2431100,2836100,18422300,24482300,39140000,8851800,6941700,11767100,2327300,3556000,1435700,2480900,6143700,3463200,42763000,8215000,20184300,2307900]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.parlogroup.com","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","employees":68,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Parlo Berhad, an investment holding company, provides travel and ticketing agency services for airline companies in Malaysia. The company operates through four segments: Travel and Tours; Trading; Investment Holding; and Others. It offers a range of travel products and services for outbound and domestic travel services. The company also provides corporate and leisure travel services; and meetings, incentives, conferences, events, and exhibitions for its corporate travel customers. In addition, it is involved in the provision of ancillary travel services, including visa applications, travel insurance, and other travel support services; sale of gas to the users through mains; wholesale of goods; and retail and wholesale of airline tickets to its corporate travel customers and travel agents. Further, the company offers human resource consultancy services; and distributes and trades in medical devices consumables, pharmaceuticals, health and wellness products, and household care products. Parlo Berhad is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Parlo Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，通过四个业务分部运营：旅游与旅行、贸易、投资控股及其他。公司为马来西亚航空公司提供旅行和票务代理服务，并面向企业和休闲旅客提供多种旅游产品与服务。","lines":["旅游与旅行：为航空公司和客户提供出境及国内旅游产品与服务，包括票务代理、企业及休闲旅行服务。","会奖旅游：为企业客户提供会议、奖励旅游、大会、活动及展览服务。","辅助旅行服务：提供签证申请、旅行保险及其他旅行支持服务。","贸易业务：通过管道向用户销售燃气，以及商品批发。","票务销售：向企业旅行客户和旅行社零售及批发机票。","人力资源咨询：提供人力资源咨询服务。"],"lines_en":["Travel and Tours: Provides outbound and domestic travel products and services, including ticketing agency, corporate and leisure travel services.","MICE: Offers meetings, incentives, conferences, events, and exhibitions for corporate travel customers.","Ancillary Travel Services: Provides visa applications, travel insurance, and other travel support services.","Trading: Sale of gas to users through mains and wholesale of goods.","Ticket Sales: Retail and wholesale of airline tickets to corporate travel customers and travel agents.","Human Resource Consultancy: Offers human resource consultancy services."]}}